WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
[Instrumental music; no speech]
A kart flies over the desert track in slow motion.

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
New kart. New chance.
Chassis, engine and tire parts appear on the assembly screen.

00:07.000 --> 00:12.000
Bring a friend. Chase the win.
This city race is AI practice footage.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Hot track. Cool nerves.
A kart races past pyramids on the desert course.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Ice to meet you.
A kart drives through the snowy tundra.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
The sky is not the finish line.
A kart leaves the lane and flies into the air. Music fades.
